		},
		{
			"uuid": "ce398483-8ebd-4b11-b56c-ffce71da46c3",
			"title": "[Feat] Projectile weapon",
			"description": "A projectile weapon is similar to hitscan. The biggest difference is that it can charge how strong the projectile flies out. Each projectile weapon has a min and max charge.",
