					"done": false
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"uuid": "9500c87d-d388-4493-bc4c-3c88e5816da9",
			"title": "[Feat] Collectible items",
			"description": "A collectible item can be a chest or a toolbox.\nA chest unlocks a weapon for the team.\nA toolbox unlocks a tool for the team.\n\nCollectibles spawn inbetween turns, by chance. They cannot spawn on top of a player.\n\nA collectible is picked up by simply walking over it as a player.",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "fc171676-5554-423d-b507-eb84752f5017",
			"title": "[Feat] Player manager",
			"description": "The player manager should spawn players on the level, it should only know about who to spawn. It decides where and when a player spawns, it keeps track of which players are dead.",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": [
				{
					"details": "Spawns players",
					"done": false
				},
				{
					"details": "Spawn is at random location of level",
					"done": false
				},
				{
					"details": "Handles player camera priority",
					"done": false
				},
				{
					"details": "Coordinates players per team",
					"done": false
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"uuid": "785fc13f-6ad5-4b18-84a0-e4348ba2f868",
			"title": "[Feat] Teams manager",
			"description": "The team system/manager should be responsible for assignments of teams, balancing them, and communicating this to the player manager. Whenever a player from team A unlocks a weapon, all players of team A can use that weapon.",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": [
				{
					"details": ">3 players per team",
					"done": false
				},
				{
					"details": "Keeps tracks of what the team has unlocked",
					"done": false
				},
				{
					"details": "Notifies player manager of players to handle",
					"done": false
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"uuid": "e2d83811-fc76-4de2-97fe-10a54dda99c3",
			"title": "[Feat] Player knockback",
			"description": "A player should be knocked back based on the weapon they have been hit with. A weapon should define its knockback strength, have a falloff curve, and a knockback range.",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": [
				{
					"details": "Knockback is kept per resource\n",
					"done": true
				},
				{
					"details": "Knockback strength is kept per resource",
					"done": true
				},
				{
					"details": "Knockback on hurt",
					"done": true
				},
				{
					"details": "Knockback is optional on hurtbox",
					"done": true
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"uuid": "15fc6cf1-914b-4f5a-bde3-0d38139c66a5",
			"title": "[Feat] Camera when collectible spawns",
			"description": "",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "fb2bb30a-987e-41e0-8f7f-1fb6367d0f9d",
			"title": "[Feat] Chest collectible",
			"description": "A chest unlocks a weapon that hasn't been unlocked yet.\nRocker launcher is always available.",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "f3161987-5907-425b-98a9-d52d7f41bff4",
			"title": "[Feat] Toolbox collectible",
			"description": "A toolbox unlocks a tool that hasn't been unlocked yet.\n\nJetpack is always available.",
			"category": "d6502c35-261e-4a08-ba5e-1e9c184e213f",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
